OL,3,GNEWSAProtest as farmland housing plans
OL,4,Ago to inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have gathered outside a
OL,7,Fplanning inquiry which is looking into
OL,8,Fplans for up to 150 homes in a Kent
OL,9,Fvillage, amid residents' concerns about
OL,10,Fdevelopment on agricultural land.
OL,12,FThe proposal by Taylor Wimpey South
OL,13,FEast for land west of Norwood Lane in
OL,14,FMeopham includes housing, affordable
OL,15,Fhomes, public open space and associated
OL,16,Fworks.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
