OL,3,GNEWSAProtest as farmland housing plans
OL,4,Ago to inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents raised concerns about housing
OL,7,Fdevelopment across Meopham and Istead
OL,8,FRise. They said the plan was among
OL,9,Fseveral proposals in the Local Plan
OL,10,Fwhich would be built on agricultural
OL,11,Ffields.
OL,13,FGravesham Borough Council and Taylor
OL,14,FWimpey said they could not comment
OL,15,Fbefore the hearing, but Taylor Wimpey
OL,16,Fsaid it would continue to engage with
OL,17,Fthe community.
